every crossing edge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(all of capacity zero). Parallel capacities add; self-loops are ignored. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"capacity"},{"text":" is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"called once per non-loop edge, in position order, before any work (self-loops are never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asked). O(nm log n) in the worst case, far less when contractions are many.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Flows\/documentation\/Flows\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/minimumCut(capacity:)"}}}